{
  "id": "DEU.29",
  "number": "29",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Ŋikis. 29",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "29",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae nu ŋakiro ŋuna ka acamunet a ŋina abu Ekapolon kicik Moses tocamunos ka Ŋisirael anakwap a Moab kiyatakin nacamunet ŋina abu iŋes tocamunotor ka Ŋisirael alo Oreb.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kikiteteunae Acamunet alo Moab",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Moses tonyarau Ŋisirael daadaŋ, tema neni kec, “Ipotu iyes kiŋolikis ŋakiro daadaŋ ŋuna abu Ekapolon kitiya anakwap a Ijipit neni a Parao, neni a ŋikapolok a ŋulu epukatotor iŋes ka nakwap keŋ daadaŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ipotu iyes kiŋolikis ŋakikatanakineta ŋuna apolok, ŋakujuwuanisya ka ŋaumonokineta ŋuna apolok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai akitodol nakoloŋit na eriŋa Ekapolon nyeinakina iyes aosou ka ŋatameta ŋunayenunet ŋakiro, kori ŋakonyen ŋuna kiŋolikinet ŋakiro ŋuna itiyakin, kori ŋaki ŋuna kiiraret ŋakiro ŋuna adaut akitiyakin nakiyar kus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ayoŋ okorik iyes ŋikaru ŋatomoniomwon analoŋisat. Nyenyamuna ŋilowi anawat kus ka nyenyamuna ŋamuk anakejen kus; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyenyama iyes amugati ka nyemata iyes epiini, kori ŋagwe ŋuna adwarak, ikotere iyenuniata iyes atemar arae Ekapolon Akuj kus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋina adolunere iwon nakibois na, apotu erwosit Sikon ŋolo a Esibon ka erwosit Og ŋolo a Basan ikitijikis iwon, nai aponi iwon kilounae ikes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aponi iwon kikamarae akwap kec, ido okorakisi ŋituŋa a ekabila a Ruben ka ŋituŋa a ekabila a Gad ta atutubet apei a ŋituŋa a ekabila a Manase toruwor ŋina kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, kiwuapa ejok ŋakiro ŋuna ka acamunet, ikotere itiyaete a aosou ŋakiro daadaŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Akoloŋit na, icunakina iyes ne kiŋaren Ekapolon Akuj kus, iyes ka ŋikarikok a ŋikabilae, iyes ŋikasikou ŋikapolok ka iyes Ŋisirael daadaŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "icunakina iyes ne ka ŋidwe kus, ŋaberu kus ka ŋigelaanotin ŋulu iboiyete ka iyes, ŋiketiyak kus ŋulu eyepete ŋakito ka ŋulu eokete ŋakipi aŋuna kus, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "icunakina iyes ne aŋuna ka akijaun acamunet ke Ekapolon Akuj kus, acamunet ŋina ikoŋitor Akuj aŋuna yok, ŋina icamunotor iyes ke Ekapolon Akuj kus nakoloŋit na; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ikotere ikituruwori iŋes iyes nakoloŋit na ŋituŋa keŋ ka toruwor iŋes Akuj kus, lopite ŋolo eikinitor ka ekoŋitor neni atapapaa kus Aburaam, Isaka ka Yakob. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewuakini ayoŋ acamunet na ŋina ikoŋitor Akuj aŋuna yok, meere ka iyes make ŋulu iwuasi alokiŋaren Ekapolon Akuj kus nakoloŋit na, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nai iwuakini Ekapolon acamunet na tari aŋuna a ŋulu nyikiya ka iwon nakoloŋit na ne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyenete iyes epite ŋolo eboiyere iwon anakwap a Ijipit ka epite ŋolo aponere iwon kitoroi kidiŋ ŋakwapin a ŋituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iŋolikis iyes ŋiboro kec lu ŋulu eŋeritoe: Ŋitorubei a ŋakujo ŋulu etiyaunitae a ŋamoru ka ŋakito, a esilipa ka egolid, ŋitorubei ŋulu aya nakwap kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acepaki eyai kidiŋ kus ekile, kori aberu, kori ekal, kori ekabila, ŋolo ebatar etau keŋ anakiwuapit Ekapolon Akuj yok aŋuna ka akitiyanakin ŋakujo a ŋituŋa a ŋul. Nyemaikina eyai kidiŋ kus ituŋanan ŋini ikokini ekitoe ŋolo eyai adwaris, ido yau ŋican. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋulu daadaŋ iirarete ŋakiro a akikoŋiet a na, ido kitojokas make etamete alotai kec ebe, ‘Mam ŋace apote neni yok, tari kikiwuapit iwon ŋipitesyo yok ŋulu aronok.’ (Eyaunete ŋul ŋican neni a ŋulu iyookino ka ŋulu nyiyookino), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyecamuni Ekapolon akisyon ikes, anerae eŋoikini Ekapolon ikes nooi, erirauni aŋoit keŋ lopite ŋolo eriraunia akim, eryamunete nai ikes ŋilam daadaŋ ŋulu igiritae lokitaabo lo, ido ikisari Ekapolon ŋirorwa kec anakwap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esetari Ekapolon ikes alokabilae a Ŋisirael a daadaŋ toruworos ŋulu isicanio, lopite ŋolo elimunitere alolam a daadaŋ a ŋulu ka acamunet a ŋulu igiritae lokitaabo ŋolo a ŋikisila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iŋolikinete ŋidwe kus ŋulu ka anyamet a ŋina ebuni epite ŋolo kinyasunere akwap ŋin ka ŋican ŋulu kebu Ekapolon kisicania ŋituŋa ŋulu kiboiyete a nen, iŋolikinete ŋigelaanotin ŋulu epote anakwapin a ŋuna alwanak ŋakiro nu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iŋolikinete ikes ŋalup a akwap a ŋin ŋuna kenom keruwor esulpa ka acumbi, iŋolikinete emam ibore itakinitae, emam ibore erupunit, pa epedorito akitolomun ŋikito, ikwaan ka akinyasuno a Sodoma ka Gomora, Adama ka Seboim ŋitaunio ŋulu abu Ekapolon kinyasu anoŋoit keŋ a ŋina aryenyaan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eumokinete ikes kaapei ka ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin ebasi, ‘Kaanukiro etiyakinia Ekapolon ŋakiro nu nakwap na? Anukiro kitoŋoiyete iŋes nooi?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iboŋokinete ikes ŋakiŋiseta ŋun temasi, ‘Erae ŋun anerae apotu ikes toŋero acamunet ŋina ke Ekapolon Akuj atapapaa kec, acamunet ŋina abu iŋes tocamunotor ka ikes apaki ŋina ayaunia iŋes ikes anakwap a Ijipit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ikes toŋero Ekapolon, tosodi kitiyanakis ŋakujo ŋace, kilipa neni kec, arae ŋun ŋakujo ŋuna sek pa ayenete ikes ka awounit Ekapolon ikes akilip neni kec, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aŋun, abu Ekapolon toŋoik akwap, kimyek toryamu ŋilam ŋulu igiritae lokitaabo lo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Ekapolon kirita ikes anakwap kec anaŋoit keŋ, anadedeŋu keŋ ka ananyunyura keŋ, ido kirita ikes nakwap ace, lopite ŋolo eyakatar ŋakiro tokona.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
